    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/277c06ccf658dbed86450dba9dc2a344.webp?t=1753174946\" width=600 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy blend of idle progression, card collecting, and RPG mechanics. Click, collect, and unlock over <strong>1,000</strong> beautifully illustrated waifu cards, some with stunning holographic effects, while enjoying a <strong>chill</strong>, <strong>ambient experience</strong>. Explore the world of Vaifurion \u2014 a realm shaped by flame, frost, shadow, and light \u2014 where the resurfacing of the mythical Eclipse Crown has set countless heroines on a path toward power, purpose, or ruin.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/d460450ea988fbfee010e02dc442f8cd.webp?t=1753174946\" width=600 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1,000+ Collectible Cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holographic effects, multiple rarities, and full collection tracking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle &amp; Active Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click your way to progress, or let the game unfold automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lootbox System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open Basic, Mystic, Celestial, and Ethereal lootboxes to uncover cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Gallery &amp; Videos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/e59ce44c53a16f5b9cb736e77ccd25b5.poster.avif?t=1753174946\" width=512 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/e59ce44c53a16f5b9cb736e77ccd25b5.webm?t=1753174946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/e59ce44c53a16f5b9cb736e77ccd25b5.mp4?t=1753174946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ Achievements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For both casual collectors and completionists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing &amp; Stylish UI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy smooth animations, ambient effects, and a cozy atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ Custom Music Tracks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To set a certain mood and tone to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/45a418bf48c2cb2efc2d0068be36883f.webp?t=1753174946\" width=600 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across its continents, you\u2019ll encounter <strong>many distinct races</strong>, each with their own culture, powers, and secrets. From the radiant <strong>Sunchosen</strong> and enigmatic <strong>Netherbinders</strong>, to the playful <strong>Slimekin</strong> and fierce <strong>Flame Succubi</strong>, every card you collect tells a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>unique regions</strong>, from the volcanic <strong>Ashen Peaks</strong> to the twilight-cloaked <strong>Nightspire Hollow</strong>, the glowing <strong>Emerald Vale</strong>, and storm-ravaged <strong>Tempest Isles</strong>. Each area pulses with elemental energy and mystery \u2014 and all are connected by whispers of the <strong>Eclipse Crown</strong>, a forgotten relic that could reshape the world itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/7fa359569e3bbce1a400034c661249c4.poster.avif?t=1753174946\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/7fa359569e3bbce1a400034c661249c4.webm?t=1753174946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/7fa359569e3bbce1a400034c661249c4.mp4?t=1753174946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2756 <strong>Wishlist now and prepare for the ultimate card-collecting adventure!\u00a0</strong>\u2756</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/277c06ccf658dbed86450dba9dc2a344.webp?t=1753174946\" width=600 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy blend of idle progression, card collecting, and RPG mechanics. Click, collect, and unlock over <strong>1,000</strong> beautifully illustrated waifu cards, some with stunning holographic effects, while enjoying a <strong>chill</strong>, <strong>ambient experience</strong>. Explore the world of Vaifurion \u2014 a realm shaped by flame, frost, shadow, and light \u2014 where the resurfacing of the mythical Eclipse Crown has set countless heroines on a path toward power, purpose, or ruin.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/d460450ea988fbfee010e02dc442f8cd.webp?t=1753174946\" width=600 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1,000+ Collectible Cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holographic effects, multiple rarities, and full collection tracking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle &amp; Active Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click your way to progress, or let the game unfold automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lootbox System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open Basic, Mystic, Celestial, and Ethereal lootboxes to uncover cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Gallery &amp; Videos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/e59ce44c53a16f5b9cb736e77ccd25b5.poster.avif?t=1753174946\" width=512 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/e59ce44c53a16f5b9cb736e77ccd25b5.webm?t=1753174946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/e59ce44c53a16f5b9cb736e77ccd25b5.mp4?t=1753174946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ Achievements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For both casual collectors and completionists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing &amp; Stylish UI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy smooth animations, ambient effects, and a cozy atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ Custom Music Tracks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To set a certain mood and tone to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/45a418bf48c2cb2efc2d0068be36883f.webp?t=1753174946\" width=600 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across its continents, you\u2019ll encounter <strong>many distinct races</strong>, each with their own culture, powers, and secrets. From the radiant <strong>Sunchosen</strong> and enigmatic <strong>Netherbinders</strong>, to the playful <strong>Slimekin</strong> and fierce <strong>Flame Succubi</strong>, every card you collect tells a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>unique regions</strong>, from the volcanic <strong>Ashen Peaks</strong> to the twilight-cloaked <strong>Nightspire Hollow</strong>, the glowing <strong>Emerald Vale</strong>, and storm-ravaged <strong>Tempest Isles</strong>. Each area pulses with elemental energy and mystery \u2014 and all are connected by whispers of the <strong>Eclipse Crown</strong>, a forgotten relic that could reshape the world itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/7fa359569e3bbce1a400034c661249c4.poster.avif?t=1753174946\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/7fa359569e3bbce1a400034c661249c4.webm?t=1753174946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/7fa359569e3bbce1a400034c661249c4.mp4?t=1753174946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2756 <strong>Wishlist now and prepare for the ultimate card-collecting adventure!\u00a0</strong>\u2756</p>",
